&_nc_ohc=HPPgXJE5DLAQ7kNvwHOpI8b&_nc_oc=AdqlbeQ2xrdDX4B0EZSJm9MavvzeHQ29HkDGx81YLQrQPimVarXSPHCMxAZEQB3aRo4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPS8sZhmOLO-x13wLZv6vn10XRJLo0_rSREj9EV30-o-w&oe=6AE09D03"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PoeiIE2ZsCgQ7kNvwFkmA70&_nc_oc=AdqscMvzyet81ejYa_pOsSKS1j1x_o514WeQOUsY8bgZTvNLE44c-2vo90J6Z418vZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNqagD9QJHz9DQZrTkOWwVgN51dR2j95jJw854QadWluQ&oe=6AE0CBCB"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ujOh8b920nUQ7kNvwG9rKq3&_nc_oc=Adr4GRiE9XhrjM92X-zk-7k6Ueklzw_1-LwRtxieNHAucINBj66gyj4q3eaU4o5Qa9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPWXzVnQVybjUYfDzH4O9jr892BrnYB5C8SybO5K-AZ5Q&oe=6AE0AA41"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PBxSZDHWTLoQ7kNvwGI5Wqc&_nc_oc=AdpGrFh0wd3y1xk3lFNGtNdyS3rNE3UQh8r2U_bwbrAubHORmvbJsOq_9pQSoDi1nCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNScJsYJUCIhItNuFW4mdGk7R4HZrgnC6VQQEhXEvEVqg&oe=6AE0C384"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XTTAkkjHU-YQ7kNvwFU-zqV&_nc_oc=AdohsmDZ2fDgMbqkQd-uVBy9_g20jAi_wDMd3DXHgSPpbEPm1ZCkxXZeIzAsEmSO3_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPYnaC_zyOjUoyBqRdLmdStr5WLJWeynywb5sAmtdZDag&oe=6AE0B741"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gh5FrBYSpdwQ7kNvwHILP00&_nc_oc=Adpli9c4y0jcc3Hds3T0YMQhhw2aAayEqfohd3tYiHyuwEQnhLgLVRXtENmku0dTnC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIWzFHzvBM86b2KtfpQb03fMyjMG4QygnIFon0umdf0Q&oe=6AE0ABE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=drX_yuQDx1QQ7kNvwHlLSO2&_nc_oc=AdpG09hjqWvirqwFzUxDqY8MJiaNmH5JNOaTjFQy5owg7sLD9uM5tKNEdY97io7nQSQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMejja982J4t3ngnEjFr8DV7ChYqUEjLYHYxsTl3LMKqQ&oe=6AE0B224"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MKiC4TOHI6AQ7kNvwEFDdv2&_nc_oc=Adr0YLAYgLimzDgzma4om1RBjieYBkpqFtyBwXIt00zZqDyEcAkJvNAAS0XZQ36oNHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMKWQymhT0tTIN7C-x5jn3nE-PGugbbuuvnO3dccR7IbQ&oe=6AE0B4FC"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ALR2A1VHHoYQ7kNvwHx